{"a1":[{"k":"title","cap":"Merge Two Sorted Chains","say":"Let's solve Merge Two Sorted Chains, using the Two Pointers plus Dummy Head approach.","card":{"title":"Merge Two Sorted Chains","sub":"Two Pointers + Dummy Head · Easy","pattern":"two-pointers"}},{"k":"problem","cap":"a and b are heads of two sorted linked lists. Splice their nodes together into one sorted list and return its head.","card":{"lines":["a and b are heads of two sorted linked lists. Splice their nodes together into one sorted list and return its head."]}},{"k":"example","cap":"For example, with a = [1,2,4], b = [1,3,4], the answer is [1,1,2,3,4,4].","say":"For example, with a equals 1, 2, 4, b equals 1, 3, 4, the answer is 1, 1, 2, 3, 4, 4.","card":{"lines":["Input: a = [1,2,4], b = [1,3,4]","Output: [1,1,2,3,4,4]"]}},{"k":"idea","cap":"Start from a dummy node and a tail pointer. Compare the front nodes of both lists, attach the smaller one to the tail, and advance that list's pointer.","card":{"pattern":"two-pointers","name":"Two Pointers"}},{"k":"idea","cap":"When one list runs out, attach the remainder of the other list in one step.","card":{"pattern":"two-pointers","name":"Two Pointers"}},{"k":"trace","cap":"Let's walk through it with a = [1,2,4], b = [1,3,4].","say":"Let's walk through it with a equals 1, 2, 4, b equals 1, 3, 4.","st":{"linked":{"nodes":[{"id":0,"v":"1","nx":1,"row":0,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":1,"v":"2","nx":2,"row":0,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":2,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":0,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":3,"v":"1","nx":4,"row":1,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":4,"v":"3","nx":5,"row":1,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":5,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":1,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":6,"v":"0","nx":0,"row":2,"col":0,"dim":false}],"p":[{"l":"a","id":1},{"l":"b","id":3},{"l":"tail","id":6}]}}},{"k":"step","cap":"1 from the first list is smaller. Attach it.","ln":{"python":5,"java":5},"st":{"linked":{"nodes":[{"id":0,"v":"1","nx":1,"row":0,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":1,"v":"2","nx":2,"row":0,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":2,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":0,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":3,"v":"1","nx":4,"row":1,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":4,"v":"3","nx":5,"row":1,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":5,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":1,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":6,"v":"0","nx":0,"row":2,"col":0,"dim":false}],"p":[{"l":"a","id":1},{"l":"b","id":3},{"l":"tail","id":6}]}}},{"k":"step","cap":"1 from the second list is smaller. Attach it.","ln":{"python":7,"java":6},"st":{"linked":{"nodes":[{"id":0,"v":"1","nx":3,"row":0,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":1,"v":"2","nx":2,"row":0,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":2,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":0,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":3,"v":"1","nx":4,"row":1,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":4,"v":"3","nx":5,"row":1,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":5,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":1,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":6,"v":"0","nx":0,"row":2,"col":0,"dim":false}],"p":[{"l":"a","id":1},{"l":"b","id":4},{"l":"tail","id":0}]}}},{"k":"step","cap":"2 from the first list is smaller. Attach it.","ln":{"python":5,"java":5},"st":{"linked":{"nodes":[{"id":0,"v":"1","nx":3,"row":0,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":1,"v":"2","nx":2,"row":0,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":2,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":0,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":3,"v":"1","nx":1,"row":1,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":4,"v":"3","nx":5,"row":1,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":5,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":1,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":6,"v":"0","nx":0,"row":2,"col":0,"dim":false}],"p":[{"l":"a","id":2},{"l":"b","id":4},{"l":"tail","id":3}]}}},{"k":"step","cap":"3 from the second list is smaller. Attach it.","ln":{"python":7,"java":6},"st":{"linked":{"nodes":[{"id":0,"v":"1","nx":3,"row":0,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":1,"v":"2","nx":4,"row":0,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":2,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":0,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":3,"v":"1","nx":1,"row":1,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":4,"v":"3","nx":5,"row":1,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":5,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":1,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":6,"v":"0","nx":0,"row":2,"col":0,"dim":false}],"p":[{"l":"a","id":2},{"l":"b","id":5},{"l":"tail","id":1}]}}},{"k":"step","cap":"4 from the first list is smaller. Attach it.","ln":{"python":5,"java":5},"st":{"linked":{"nodes":[{"id":0,"v":"1","nx":3,"row":0,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":1,"v":"2","nx":4,"row":0,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":2,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":0,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":3,"v":"1","nx":1,"row":1,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":4,"v":"3","nx":2,"row":1,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":5,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":1,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":6,"v":"0","nx":0,"row":2,"col":0,"dim":false}],"p":[{"l":"b","id":5},{"l":"tail","id":4}]}}},{"k":"step","cap":"One list is empty, so attach the rest of the other.","ln":{"python":9,"java":9},"st":{"linked":{"nodes":[{"id":0,"v":"1","nx":3,"row":0,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":1,"v":"2","nx":4,"row":0,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":2,"v":"4","nx":5,"row":0,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":3,"v":"1","nx":1,"row":1,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":4,"v":"3","nx":2,"row":1,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":5,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":1,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":6,"v":"0","nx":0,"row":2,"col":0,"dim":false}],"p":[{"l":"b","id":5},{"l":"tail","id":2}]}}},{"k":"done","cap":"The answer is [1,1,2,3,4,4].","say":"The answer is 1, 1, 2, 3, 4, 4.","st":{"linked":{"nodes":[{"id":0,"v":"1","nx":3,"row":0,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":1,"v":"2","nx":4,"row":0,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":2,"v":"4","nx":5,"row":0,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":3,"v":"1","nx":1,"row":1,"col":0,"dim":false},{"id":4,"v":"3","nx":2,"row":1,"col":1,"dim":false},{"id":5,"v":"4","nx":-1,"row":1,"col":2,"dim":false},{"id":6,"v":"0","nx":0,"row":2,"col":0,"dim":false}],"p":[{"l":"b","id":5},{"l":"tail","id":2}]}}},{"k":"complexity","cap":"Time complexity is O(n + m) and extra space is O(1).","say":"Time complexity is O of n plus m and extra space is O of one.","card":{"time":"O(n + m)","space":"O(1)"}},{"k":"outro","cap":"That's the Two Pointers + Dummy Head approach. Now try writing it yourself, in Java or Python!","say":"That's the Two Pointers plus Dummy Head approach. Now try writing it yourself, in Java or Python!"}]}